# Shared password for every Family Termite tech.
# This example is not the password. Copy this file to password.config.
# password.config stays on your computer. It is not uploaded with the site.
#
# 1. Replace the value below with a new password, at least 12 characters.
# 2. Do not reuse a password that was already published in this repository.
# 3. Save the file.
# 4. Run: node _build/build.js
# 5. Commit index.html and push it to main.
#
# Spaces at the start or end of the password are removed.

QUOTEMASTER_PASSWORD=REPLACE_WITH_A_LONG_PASSWORD
